guessing. Learn the basic inputs for great photos so you can choose better 
ones for your website.]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p class="">If you have never taken a photography class before, I guarantee that after watching this video you will choose better photos. It’s also good for those of you who took photography a LONG time ago!</p>























